        N: '3p ⁴D° at 211 nm (two-photon, ⁴S°₃/₂ → ⁴D°₇/₂ is |ΔJ| = 2) and 3p ⁴P°, ⁴S° a little to the blue. The ²D° and ²P° metastables are also listed.',
